| Scenario | Result |
|---|---|
| File doesn't exist | `{ ...defaults }` |
| File has invalid JSON | `{ ...defaults }` |
| File has `null`, `[]`, or `"str"` | `{ ...defaults }` |
| Valid object | `{ ...defaults, ...fileConfig }` (shallow merge) |

## Notes & variations

- **Shallow vs deep merge:** The `{ ...defaults, ...parsed }` above is a shallow merge. If you have nested config (e.g. `{ db: { host, port } }`) and want partial overrides, swap in a deep merge:

  ```js
